# Peer-dependency conflicts are resolved explicitly via package.json "overrides"
# (React 19, drei/fiber, expo-constants) and version alignment (Capacitor 7.x,
# typescript-eslint), not a blanket legacy-peer-deps. See US-260. Do not re-add
# legacy-peer-deps=true — it masks real incompatibilities and can pull
# mismatched trees between local and prod.
